[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "星の恵みが～♪\u3000我らを導くだろう～～～♪",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "May the stars' blessing ♪ Guide us always ♪"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "案内人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Star Guide"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ん～……もうちょっとこう、感情を込めて……\n聴いている人の心が、揺さぶられるような",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm... needs more feeling... Something that really moves people's hearts..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "案内人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Star Guide"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うわぁぁぁ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Aaaaaah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "住民Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citizen A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "な、何じゃあ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wh-what was that!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "案内人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Star Guide"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "魔物！？\u3000こんな街の近くに！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Monsters!? This close to town!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "案内人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Star Guide"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（聖戦士の人たち……苦戦してるみたい）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The Sacred Knights... they seem to be struggling.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "案内人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Star Guide"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "くっ……皆、立ち上がれ！\n我らの天命を全うするんだ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ngh... Everyone, on your feet! We must fulfill our divine calling!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "聖戦士Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sacred Knight A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うおおおおおおっ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Raaaaaaaaaah!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "聖戦士Ｂ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sacred Knight B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "魔物はみんなが退治してくれたから、もう大丈夫だよ。\nケガはない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The knights took care of the monsters, so we're safe now. Are you hurt?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "案内人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Star Guide"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ、大丈夫だよ。\nそれより、聖戦士の方たちは……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, I'm fine. But the Sacred Knights..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "住民Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citizen A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何人かケガしちゃったみたい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Looks like some of them are injured."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "案内人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Star Guide"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こんな街の近くに魔物が出るなんて、災難でしたね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Monsters appearing this close to town... what terrible luck."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "案内人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Star Guide"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "街を守るのは我々が授かった天命。\nそれを全うできたのだ、災難とは思わないさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Protecting the town is our divine calling. Fulfilling that duty could never be considered misfortune."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "聖戦士Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sacred Knight A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ。これも星の神が我々に与えた試練なのだろう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. This must be another trial from the Star God."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "聖戦士Ｂ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sacred Knight B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っと、……早く治療しないと！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh... we need to treat those wounds quickly!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "案内人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Star Guide"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アタシ、薬持ってくるね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll go get some medicine!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "案内人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Star Guide"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっと、ここから一番近いのは、\n街の入口にある薬屋さんかな……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's see, the closest place would be... the apothecary by the town entrance!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "案内人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Star Guide"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そこのお前",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You there."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わっ！？\u3000な、何！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eek!? Wh-what is it!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "案内人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Star Guide"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ケガ人の薬を調達するところだろう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're looking for medicine for the wounded, aren't you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うちに来るがいい\nちょうど今作っていたところだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come to my place. I was just making some."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "案内人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Star Guide"
        }
      }
    }
  }
